mrtg dropped them and asked the agent with the defaults (oetiker/mrtg #94). Upstream
after 2.17.10 (c2f79f4, 21.06.2023, pull request #106), as Debian carries it (mrtg
2.17.10, debian/patches/070_fix-RouterUpTime.patch).

